Restore the Filament Schema Health admin UI that shipped in v1.2.x.

Apply with:
    git apply patches/0001-filament-schema-health.patch

After applying you also need to:
  - add "filament/filament": "^3.2" to composer.json require-dev
  - in ProductSchemaServiceProvider::boot(), load views and translations:
        $this->loadViewsFrom(__DIR__.'/../resources/views', 'lunar-product-schemas');
        $this->loadTranslationsFrom(__DIR__.'/../resources/lang', 'lunar-product-schemas');
  - register the plugin in your PanelProvider:
        $panel->plugin(\WizcodePl\LunarProductSchemas\Filament\LunarProductSchemasPlugin::make());

The bundled SchemaHealthReport service is restored alongside the UI; if you
keep the new ProductSchemaHealthCheck, the two coexist (different consumers,
same underlying data).

